menu "BLE Connection (GATT client) - F2.4"

    config BLE_CONN_ENABLED
        bool "Enable BLE connection (GATT client) support"
        default y
        select BT_NIMBLE_ROLE_CENTRAL
        help
            Optional central-role connection feature: connect to one peer,
            read JSON from a GATT characteristic (notifications, or periodic
            reads as fallback) and re-stream it on the USB JSON line stream
            as "src":"conn" lines. When disabled, the firmware behaves
            identically to v1.0.0 (passive observer only).

endmenu
